,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"暂时仅支持 Bash 和 ZSH 环境"
,
"en"
:
"Currently only supports Bash and ZSH environments"
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Launch preset key bindings to trigger assigned actions\n  co (Ctrl+X):          Pass the current command-line input as a value to execute `x co --exec`, enabling quick code operations (e.g., Git commits, snippet insertion).\n  fzf-history (Ctrl+R): Fuzzy-search through shell command history and insert the selected command into the current prompt for execution (supports multi-line preview and advanced filtering) using FZF.\n  fzf-file (Ctrl+T):    Interactively search for files/directories (including hidden ones) and insert the selected path(s) at the cursor position for quick editing or execution (e.g., `vim`, `cat`) using FZF.\n  fzf-cd (Alt+C):       Fuzzy-search for directories and immediately `cd` into the selected path, eliminating manual path typing using FZF.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"启动预设快捷键绑定以触发指定功能\n  co (Ctrl+X):          将当前命令行文本作为参数传给 `x co --exec` 执行，用于快速代码操作（如 Git 提交、插入代码片段等）\n  fzf-history (Ctrl+R): 使用 FZF 在 Shell 历史中模糊搜索并将选中命令插入当前提示符执行，支持多行预览与高级筛选\n  fzf-file (Ctrl+T):    使用 FZF 交互式搜索文件/目录（含隐藏文件），将选中路径插入光标位置，便于快速编辑或执行（如 `vim`、`cat`）\n  fzf-cd (Alt+C):       使用 FZF 模糊搜索目录并切换到选中路径，无需输入完整路径\n"
}
,
